    353					 ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    354					 ; Startup and lifetime. Only Main owns	the event loop and termination.
    355					 ; DOSSEG puts the stack last: shrink the PSP block through its	END,
    356					 ; not through the current SP. DOS can then allocate the released paragraphs.
    357					 ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
